# Selection docs

Before nontrivial changes here, **Read** [docs/selection.md](docs/selection.md).

Invariants:

- Selection is a `Set` of XML **component ids**, not tree keys.
- `displayIf` / filters affect visibility; level strip mass-checks; filters never clear selection.
- Alternatives-aware parent checked state; `core` off clears the whole `<mod>`; prune gated-out non-required after `alwaysIf`.
- Export / install order = document `orderIndex`, first id wins, skip `noExport`.
